  "label": "The woman is mapped as the speaker of the text",
  "description": "The text 'am i gonna wish you happy birthday?' and 'dafuq else im'a do' is presented as if spoken by the woman in the image. Her skeptical, questioning expression and posture visually represent the speaker's exasperated, weary resignation, creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the woman) embodies the textual entity (the speaker of the dialogue).",
